<title>POLAND: Remak trades on kerb at PLN 10.</title>
<headline>Remak trades on kerb at PLN 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 100,000 shares in Remak priced at 10 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Remak traded at 10.4 zlotys in 95,541 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
